---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Support"
  eyebrow="Help with ilyStream"
  description="Report a problem, request help, or privately disclose a security issue through the official ilyStream project channels."
  updated="July 12, 2026"
>
  <h2>Product support</h2>
  <p>
    Use the <a href="https://github.com/ilydrw/ilyStream/issues" rel="noopener">ilyStream issue tracker</a>
    for setup questions, reproducible bugs, and feature requests. Search existing issues first so
    related reports stay together.
  </p>
  <p>
    Include your ilyStream version, Windows version, the feature involved, what you expected, what
    happened, and the smallest sequence that reproduces the problem. Logs are useful, but review
    them before attaching anything.
  </p>

  <h2>Protect sensitive information</h2>
  <p>
    GitHub issues are public. Never include passwords, OAuth codes, access or refresh tokens, stream
    keys, session cookies, API keys, private chat, personal addresses, or unredacted logs containing
    those values.
  </p>

  <h2>Security reports</h2>
  <p>
    Do not disclose an unpatched vulnerability in a public issue. Use
    <a href="https://github.com/ilydrw/ilyStream/security/advisories/new" rel="noopener">GitHub's private vulnerability reporting flow</a>
    so the report can be reviewed before details are published.
  </p>

  <h2>Privacy and account requests</h2>
  <p>
    For questions about local data, connected accounts, or an ilyStream-operated authorization
    session, open a minimal support issue that contains no private data and request a private
    follow-up. You can also disconnect the relevant platform directly in ilyStream and revoke the
    application's access from that platform's account settings.
  </p>

  <h2>Useful links</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}docs/getting-started/`}>Getting started guide</a></li>
    <li><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}docs/platforms/`}>Platform setup</a></li>
    <li><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}download/`}>Download the current release</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/ilydrw/ilyStream" rel="noopener">Source code and releases</a></li>
  </ul>
</LegalLayout>
